      "short": "The bill would extend the Bureau of Land Management's authority to collect oil and gas permit processing fees through fiscal year 2037. For each new permit application, the agency would collect a fee that goes into the BLM Permit Processing Improvement Fund. Under current law, this fee authority runs only through fiscal year 2026.",
